         <rs type="work" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="db:4511"><expan>thams cad</expan> yod par smra ba'i dge tshul rnaMs kyi <lb n="33b6"/> bslab pa'i rim pa ston pa'i rnaM par bshad pa</rs> || <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="db:3818">shag kya'i dge slong brtson 'grus 'bar</rs> gyi zhabs kyi pad ma'i rdul la spyi bos btugs pa'i <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="db:3831"><choice><reg>dge</reg><orig>dg(e)</orig></choice> slong chos kyi seng ge</rs>s sbyar ba || || rdzogs s+ho ||</seg>
